{"x":8,"y":1,"captures":[[{"rule":0,"flash":[],"flips":[{"p":0,"t":0,"i":"red/6d3c7451714f402d38405d3b3870353d6826797654544c2b3e38385f5c"}]}]],"p1s":4,"p2s":6,"eb":0,"z":"red/266c2a353b77527c645422707448214d5f63393d542a4f764e71215248","u":1,"c":"21","dialog":[[],[{"buttons":[{"name":"Eureka!","direction":1}],"content":"<p>A Capture!</p><p>Red just placed a card with a rank of 7 on its left side next to a blue card with an adjacent rank of 5.</p><p>7 > 5 = Capture!</p><p>Notice red's score increased?</p>"}]],"gameover":[]}
{"x":3,"y":"3","captures":[[{"rule":0,"flash":[],"flips":[{"p":0,"t":1,"i":"Ymx1ZQ==/6d3c7451714f402d38405d3b3870353d6826797654544c2b3e38385f5c"}]}]],"p1s":5,"p2s":5,"eb":0,"z":"Ymx1ZQ==/5931584c7a6d6b49547937652920385a64317d5b393f6a2231386c3b42","u":2,"c":"22","dialog":[[],[{"buttons":[{"name":"Okay","direction":1}],"content":"<p>Blue strikes back!</p><p>Blue's card with a top rank of 5 is greater than red's card with a bottom rank of 4.</p><p>This ties the game up again at 5 for each.</p>"}]],"gameover":[]}
{"x":7,"y":6,"captures":[[{"rule":0,"flash":[],"flips":[{"p":3,"t":1,"i":"red/5931584c7a6d6b49547937652920385a64317d5b393f6a2231386c3b42"}]}]],"p1s":4,"p2s":6,"eb":0,"z":"red/2c6f2d4124715833525953582c385b40436b7044526921586e2f405f79","u":1,"c":"12","dialog":[[],[{"buttons":[{"name":"Interesting..","direction":1}],"content":"<p>Although red has the lead, their board defense is weak. Notice how several low ranks are exposed to open positions?</p><p>Play defensively by keeping high ranks next to open positions if possible.</p>"}]],"gameover":[]}
