{"x":9,"y":7,"captures":[[{"rule":0,"flash":[],"flips":[]}]],"p1s":7,"p2s":3,"eb":0,"z":"red/24427a332371552b394d743146382927424a6c737d7b2d59784e7e2855","u":1,"c":"18","dialog":[[],[{"buttons":[{"name":"Thanks!","end":0}],"content":"<p>Blue crushes red 7-3!</p><p>All cards are returned to their owners at the end of the game regardless of who captured them.</p><p>Draw games (5-5) are common and do not count as a win or loss on your overall record.</p><p>Kupo!</p>"}]],"gameover":[]}
